<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Emerson Electric started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Emerson Electric started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities initiated coverage of Emerson Electric Co as a hold, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Emerson Electric gained 1/8 to 54-5/8.</p>
</text>
